  <language>en_US</language>
  <keyword>mtimes</keyword>
  <short_description>Matrix multiplication, * operator</short_description>
  <syntax>
    <syntax_item>C = mtimes(A, B)</syntax_item>
    <syntax_item>C = A * B</syntax_item>
  </syntax>
  <param_input>
    <param_input_item>
      <param_name>A</param_name>
      <param_description>a variable, a table or a timetable. When the other operand is a table or timetable, it must be a scalar.</param_description>
    </param_input_item>
    <param_input_item>
      <param_name>B</param_name>
      <param_description>a variable, a table or a timetable. When the other operand is a table or timetable, it must be a scalar.</param_description>
    </param_input_item>
  </param_input>
  <param_output>
    <param_output_item>
      <param_name>C</param_name>
      <param_description>result of A * B</param_description>
    </param_output_item>
  </param_output>
  <description>
    <p>
      <b>C = mtimes(A, B)</b> performs matrix multiplication operation: A * B.</p>
    <p>When one operand is a table or timetable and the other operand is a scalar, <b>A * B</b> is an element-wise operation applied to every variable, identical to <b>A .* B</b>: variable names, units and row times are kept. Any other combination with a table or timetable (two tables, or a table and a non-scalar array) is an error: use <b>.*</b> instead.</p>
  </description>
  <used_function />
  <bibliography />
  <examples>
    <example_item>
      <example_item_type>nelson</example_item_type>
      <example_item_description />
      <example_item_data
        runnable="cli"
      ><![CDATA[mtimes(3, 4)
3 * 4]]></example_item_data>
    </example_item>
    <example_item>
      <example_item_type>nelson</example_item_type>
      <example_item_description />
      <example_item_data
        runnable="cli"
      ><![CDATA[M1 = [2 6 10; 4 8 70];
M2 = [-25 88 1; 23 29 41; 24 40 0];
M1 * M2]]></example_item_data>
    </example_item>
    <example_item>
      <example_item_type>nelson</example_item_type>
      <example_item_description>Element-wise operation between a table and a scalar.</example_item_description>
      <example_item_data
        runnable="cli"
      ><![CDATA[T = table([1; 2], [3; 4]);
T * 2
0.5 * T]]></example_item_data>
    </example_item>
  </examples>
